        "original_id": "381d5699-c199-5b1b-8c6e-f9680fdb76ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lucy Fry, Marina Oswald, Lee Harvey Oswald, Eve, Mick Taylor\n- Works: 11.22.63, Wolf Creek, Wolf Creek 2, Wolf Creek (TV series)\n- Companies/Platforms: Hulu, Stan\n- Roles: Australian actress\n- Topics: Horror web television series, spin-off\n\nFacts:\n- Lucy Fry was born on 13 March 1992 and is an Australian actress.\n- Lucy Fry was cast in Hulu's eight-part miniseries 11.22.63 as Marina Oswald, the wife of Lee Harvey Oswald.\n- In 2016, Lucy Fry played the lead in the Australian horror television series Wolf Creek.\n- Wolf Creek is a 2016 Australian horror web television series that screens on Stan.\n- Wolf Creek is a spin-off of the films Wolf Creek and Wolf Creek 2.\n- Wolf Creek follows Eve, a 19-year-old American tourist who is targeted by serial killer Mick Taylor, survives his attack, and begins a mission of revenge.",
